      },
      { only = "Mage", source = "polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb",
        { "text", text = "The Infernal Orb" },
        { "text", text = "The Burning Blade Summoners (level 38-39, not elite) work the Mannoroc Coven in southern Desolace, east of Shadowprey Village, and every one carries an |cOXP_LOOT_Infernal Orb|r. They cast Shadow Bolt from 40 yards, keep an imp at their side and run for help at low health; Nether Maidens patrol the pillared ruin beside them, so pull with care. Horde mages: one more summoner stands alone in western Mulgore, south-west of Thunder Bluff." },
        { "goto", x = 66.49, y = 77.94, zone = "1443" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 1954, text = "Infernal Orb: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Infernal Orb|r: |cOXP_ENEMY_Burning Blade Summoner|r)" },
        { "mob", name = "Burning Blade Summoner" },
      },
      { only = "Mage", source = "polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb",
        { "text", text = "The Exorcism" },
        { "text", text = "Back at |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tabetha|r's. Hand in the orb now; The Exorcism waits for level 38. Kill the critters around the cottage first: they join the fight. Accepting The Exorcism starts a 3 minute timer, and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tabetha|r calls the |cOXP_ENEMY_Demon of the Orb|r out in her garden: a level 40 elite that resists many spells, roots and slows. Grouping up is encouraged: a mage of 40 may need help or potions, at about 45 it is soloable. You can pull it from range from the dock. The timer keeps running after it dies, so hand the quest in straight away. If time runs out, abandon the quest and take it again; she calls the demon again." },
        { "goto", x = 46.06, y = 57.09, zone = "1445" },
        { "turnin", quest = 1954, text = "Turn in The Infernal Orb" },
        { "target", name = "Tabetha" },
