        { "text", text = "At 35 |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Kaal Soulreaper|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Magic Quarter|r sends you to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Menara Voidrender|r in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar." },
