      { only = "Warlock", source = "polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tabetha|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tabetha|r lives at her farm in the middle of Dustwallow Marsh, south of the road from the Barrens and south-west of Theramore; a spirit healer stands beside it. Deadmire, a level 45 crocolisk, patrols the creeks just north-east. Hand in the orb now; Cleansing waits for level 38. Before you accept it, clear the spiders and crocolisks around her paddock. Accepting starts a 3-minute timer: she walks to the paddock and lets the |cOXP_ENEMY_Demon of the Orb|r out. It is elite (level 40): grouping up is encouraged; a warlock of about 40 can solo it with Fear or Banish and damage over time, a level 38 one brings a friend. The timer keeps running after the kill, so hand in at once. If time runs out, abandon the quest and take it from |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tabetha|r again." },
        { "goto", x = 46.06, y = 57.09, zone = "1445" },
